## 5. Phase 5 — CI Wiring (optional, ask first)

If Phase 1.6 found an existing CI test stage, offer — don't silently add —
a wiring change: extend the existing stage's command/dependency list rather
than creating a parallel workflow file. If no CI test stage exists, offer a
minimal workflow snippet (`.github/workflows/functional-tests.yml`) that
runs only the newly generated suite, gated behind explicit user consent
before writing.

