End every run with a concrete summary, not prose:

```
Framework:        <BDD | Karate | Playwright | Hybrid>
Files created:     <list, with paths>
Files modified:  <list — build file/dependency additions, CI config>
Scenarios generated: <count>, covering <N of M> discovered endpoints/flows
Explicitly out of scope this run: <list + why — e.g. deferred per batching>
Flagged gaps: <e.g. "3 endpoints have no OpenAPI schema — assertions are
