## Appendix — Quick Detection Heuristics Reference

| You see... | It means... | Affects... |
|---|---|---|
| `springdoc-openapi` / `springfox` dependency | Auto-generated OpenAPI spec available at runtime | Prefer parsing the live/generated spec over static annotation scraping |
| `@PreAuthorize`, Spring Security filter chain | Auth is role/scope-gated per endpoint | Karate/BDD auth setup must fetch a token with matching scope per scenario |
| `data-testid` attributes present in components | Stable selector strategy already in place | Playwright locators use `getByTestId` as first choice |
| No `data-testid`, only class names | Fragile selector surface | Flag per stop condition 7.2 before generating UI tests |
| `karate-junit5` already in `pom.xml` | Karate is already the convention | Skip framework question, confirm scope only |
| `.github/workflows/*.yml` runs `mvn test` / `npm test` | Existing CI test stage | Extend it in Phase 5 rather than adding a parallel workflow |
